{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Molecular.co_lp_dual_binding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Molecular.co_lp_dual_binding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Defs.PartialOrder"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.co_lp_dual_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.co_lp_dual_binding","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L83-L97","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `CoGroundStateSelection`)** — the resolving\ndeclaration for `lean.ref` `qou:QOU.Molecular.co_lp_dual_binding`.\n\nConjoins the *definitional* triple-bond selection `k* = 3` with the\ntwo *derived* minimality inequalities `Φ₁(3) ≤ Φ₁(1)` and\n`Φ₁(3) ≤ Φ₁(2)`.  The inequalities are derived from the §3b-cond\nhypothesis, not projected. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:co-lp-dual-binding","label":"prop:co-lp-dual-binding","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/co-lp-dual-binding.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.co_triple_beats_double","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.co_triple_beats_double","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L73-L81","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `CoGroundStateSelection`)** — the triple bond\nbeats the double bond: `Φ₁(3) ≤ Φ₁(2)`.  Derived by instantiating\nthe minimisation *hypothesis* at `k = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.co_triple_beats_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.co_triple_beats_single","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L63-L71","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `CoGroundStateSelection`)** — the triple bond\nbeats the single bond: `Φ₁(3) ≤ Φ₁(1)`.  Derived by instantiating\nthe minimisation *hypothesis* at `k = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoGroundStateSelection.triple_minimises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoGroundStateSelection.triple_minimises","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Bond order 3 minimises `Φ₁` over the candidate orders (the\nground-state selection hypothesis). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoGroundStateSelection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoGroundStateSelection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoGroundStateSelection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoGroundStateSelection","kind":"class","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L53-L61","doc":"§3b-cond conjecture class (non-degenerate per AGENTS.md §3b-cond\nitem 5): carries the conjectural LP-dual *hypothesis* — bond order\n`3` minimises `Φ₁` over the candidate bond orders `{1, 2, 3}` — as a\nfield, NOT the conclusion (the minimality inequalities are *derived*\nfrom it below). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.Phi_1_k","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.Phi_1_k","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L51-L51","doc":"`Φ₁` at bond order `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.k_star_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.k_star_def","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The triple bond is selected: `k* = 3` (definitional input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.k_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.k_star","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The selected CO bond order `k* ∈ {1, 2, 3}` (definitional input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.CoLpDualBindingContext","kind":"class","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/co_lp_dual_binding.lean#L43-L51","doc":"Data of the CO LP-dual-binding claim. All fields are *inputs*; none\nis the conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}